{"text": "Good morning to you, friend; I trust the forge burns bright today.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.05, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Well met, Steinar.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.05, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Greetings, all who gather in the great hall this evening.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.05, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Good day, Halvar; the mine has been kind to us of late.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.05, "names": ["Halvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Salutations, stranger. You are welcome at our gate.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.05, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Good evening.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I bid you welcome, Gudrun, to our humble table.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.05, "names": ["Gudrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Hail, outsider.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.15, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Farewell, Brokk; may the forge stay lit until your return.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.05, "names": ["Brokk"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Farewell.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I must take my leave; the road to the mine grows dark.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Farewell, and safe travels to you all.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.05, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Until we meet again, Ingrid.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Ingrid"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Good night.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I depart for the farm; do keep the gate barred.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Farewell to you, and to the whole of the clan.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Fine weather today.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I confess I could devour an entire loaf at this very moment.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.05, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.05, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "The ore veins run deep this season, or so I am told.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Quite a fine day for mending nets down at the farm.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I could drink the tavern dry this evening, given the chance.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.05, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Autumn approaches; I can feel it in the mine's cold air.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "The gate creaks louder with each passing winter, Vidar.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Vidar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Business at the market has been slow of late.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Well.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Quiet day.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "The bread rises well when the hearth is warm.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I do believe the goblin trader grows more insolent each visit.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "One could set one's watch by Orm's snoring, I daresay.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Orm"], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Might you tell me the price of a pickaxe today?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Has anyone seen Kolbrun since the morning bell?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Kolbrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "How fares the harvest at the farm this year?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "What manner of creature did you encounter in the mine?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Is the treasure vault secure, Eitri?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.3, "names": ["Eitri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Do you suppose the goblin trader can be trusted?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Well?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Where might I find a decent blade in this settlement?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "The hour, Torvi?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Torvi"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Does the clan intend to march before nightfall?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.4, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "What news from the gate, Steinar?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.3, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Might you spare a moment to inspect this blade, Dvalin?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Dvalin"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I would be grateful for a portion of bread, if any remains.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Might I request a flagon of ale, Frida?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Frida"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Would you kindly fetch more ore from the mine before dusk?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I should like to purchase a pickaxe, if the price is fair.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Kindly see to the treasury ledger before the council convenes.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Might we borrow your hammer for the day, Borin?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Borin"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I ask only that the gate be watched through the night.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Would the clan consider lending aid to the eastern farm?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "A moment, please.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Everyone is to proceed to the gate at once!", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.9, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "See to the forge before the embers die, Eitri.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.5, "names": ["Eitri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Bar the gate and rouse the watch immediately.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.8, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sheath your blade at once, this is a place of peace.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Take this ore to the forge without delay, Ragna.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.5, "names": ["Ragna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Move.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.6, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Leave the treasury.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Stand fast and hold the line, all of you.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.8, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Report to the great hall at first light, Hrolf.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.4, "names": ["Hrolf"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Proceed.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I would gladly trade you a pickaxe for a sack of grain.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Allow me to repair your armor before you depart, Skadi.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Skadi"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "You are welcome to share our bread this evening.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.05, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I shall stand watch at the gate, should you wish to rest.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Permit me to escort you through the mine, for safety's sake.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I offer you a share of the treasure, in exchange for your aid.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "A round of ale, on the house, Grimhild.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.05, "names": ["Grimhild"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Should you need a blade forged anew, my hammer stands ready.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I would be honored to teach the younglings their letters.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.05, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Well done, Brynja; the blade you forged is without equal.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.8, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Brynja"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "My thanks for your generosity, good sir.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Splendid work.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "You stubborn old goat, that was the finest ale I have tasted.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "I am most grateful for your counsel, Gudrun.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Gudrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "The clan is fortunate to have a smith as skilled as you.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Well done, all of you; the harvest is safely stored.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Your courage at the gate did not go unnoticed, Vidar.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Vidar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "My compliments to whoever brewed this batch of ale.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Most kind.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "My apologies, Runa; I did not intend to give offense.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Runa"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sorry, Runa.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.05, "names": ["Runa"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I regret the harsh words I spoke at the forge, Dagna.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Dagna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Forgive me for arriving so late to the council.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I ought not have doubted your skill with the axe, Halvar.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.05, "names": ["Halvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "My apologies for the spoiled bread; the fault was mine.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I am sorry, truly, for the trouble I have caused your household.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "It was wrong of me to accuse you before the whole clan.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sindri fights like a startled goat; it is a wonder he still draws breath.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "A remarkable feat, Borin, missing a target the size of a barn door.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Borin"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Coward.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "One does wonder how Grimhild manages to burn water at the hearth.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Grimhild"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Such fine craftsmanship, Vidar; a shame the handle snapped on the first swing.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Vidar"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Steinar has not done an honest day's work at the mine in years.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "You are a disgrace to the forge, and well you know it.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Liar.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "The goblin trader has all the honesty of a rusted coin.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "It would be a great pity should Borin's forge suffer some misfortune.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.3, "names": ["Borin"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Should Steinar wander near the spider nest again, he need not expect rescue.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.3, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Let Orm touch my tools again, and he shall lose more than his pride.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Orm"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "It would go poorly for Kolbrun should the debt remain unpaid by moonrise.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.4, "names": ["Kolbrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Whoever breaks the vault seal shall answer to me before the sun sets.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Should Yngvar spill my ale again, he shall be buying the next ten rounds.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Yngvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Should Ragna shirk her duties at the farm again, she shall answer for it.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Ragna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Should Alvis set foot in my mine uninvited again, he shall not walk out twice.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.7, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.3, "names": ["Alvis"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Creepers!", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.9, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Someone should warn Tova that zombies approach the eastern mine.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.7, "names": ["Tova"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Mind the lava near the mine shaft; it runs closer than it seems.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.6, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Careful, the ice on the well's edge looks treacherous this morning.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.4, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "The treasury door has been left unbarred; that is no small matter.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Someone must tell Brokk there are spiders in the lower tunnels.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.7, "names": ["Brokk"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Warn Ingrid the tavern's back stair has rotted through.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.5, "names": ["Ingrid"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Tell Dagna wolves have been seen near the farm after dusk.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.6, "names": ["Dagna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Beware.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.6, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "It seems the treasury has grown lighter since Sindri's last visit.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "I would not trust Halvar with the ledgers again; his sums never balance.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Halvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Was it Torvi who finished the last of the good ale?", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Torvi"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Someone has been dipping into the treasury again, and I have my suspicions about Yngvar.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Yngvar"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "I don't suppose Gudrun knows why the storehouse count keeps coming up short.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Gudrun"], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "The spider silk in the storeroom did not simply vanish on its own.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Thief!", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
